      en: ["The initial plans for the park's design were drafted in 1860.", "The park covers an area of approximately 5.5 hectares in the city center.", "The official opening ceremony of the park took place in 1910.", "The Sundukyan Theatre was built within the park grounds in 1966.", "The monument dedicated to the fictional character Pepo is located here.", "The French Embassy in Armenia is situated directly on the edge of the park."],
